   "html_text": "A second worry has to do with the fact that RES+REU appears to be too liberal. Take this case. Yesterday, Angelina had the visual experience of a red apple. On the night of June 15, 1815, Napoleon conjured up the visual image of a red apple. Angelina used her visual mechanism to see, while Napoleon reused his to imagine. If we add to this that Napoleon’s mental state resembled Angelina’s, RES+REU predicts that Napoleon’s (token) visual image was a mental simulation of Angelina’s (token) visual e",
